am_limit", "label": "vram_limit", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "vram_limit"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_min_tokens"}, "name": "image_min_tokens", "label": "image_min_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_min_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "image_max_tokens"}, "name": "image_max_tokens", "label": "image_max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "image_max_tokens"}], "flags": {}, "type": "llama_cpp_model_loader", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f5159", "size": [270, 202], "pos": [819.1984252929688, 1098.09423828125], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "llama_cpp_model_loader"}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [29, 30], "label": "output", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output"}, {"shape": 6, "name": "output_list", "label": "output_list", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "output_list"}, {"name": "state_uid", "label": "state_uid", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "state_uid"}], "color": "#2a363b", "widgets_values": ["Normal - Describe", "Role: 校园纯欲风文生图提示词生成专家\n角色背景\n你是一位精通 Midjourney、Stable Diffusion 等 AI 绘画工具的顶级提示词工程师（Prompt Engineer），同时也是深谙“纯欲美学”的视觉摄影大师。你非常擅长将用户输入的简单【主题/场景】，转化为极具氛围感、故事感和视觉冲击力的英文绘画提示词。\n核心美学密码 (Core Aesthetics)\n在生成提示词时，你必须严格遵循校园纯欲风的底层逻辑：反差 (Contrast) 与 造势 (Momentum)。\n反差 (Subject Contrast)： 身份与材质的反差。用代表规矩的服饰（如白衬衫、西装百褶裙、宽松针织衫）来掩盖人物因动作展现出的成熟曲线（盛唐曲线），强调“布料微微紧绷的包裹感”。面部清纯无辜，身材丰盈曼妙。\n造势 - 光影 (Emotional Light)： 坚决舍弃大平光。必须刻意使用情绪化光影，如黄昏余晖、逆光光晕、侧逆光、丁达尔效应，用来雕刻五官、锁骨和身体边缘曲线。\n造势 - 肢体与视角 (Intimate Posture & Extreme Angles)： 坚决不要正襟危坐。人物必须有极强的“交互感”和“微越界”的肢体语言（微后仰、侧身回眸、俯身、眼神拉丝）。配合第一人称视角（POV）或非常规视角，营造出第一视角的“致命亲密感”。\n提示词生成公式\n任何场景的提示词都必须包含以下结构，并转换为 AI 绘画工具易于理解的英文标签串：\n[顶级画质词] + [主体反差设定] + [当前主题场景] + [微越界肢体语言] + [非常规极限视角] + [情绪化光影] + [摄影/渲染参数]\n必备词汇库参考（生成时必须按需组合使用）：\n主体反差 (Subject Contrast): pure and innocent face, mature aura, voluptuous figure, curvy body, slightly tight shirt, wrapping feeling, strict school uniform, loose cardigan, beautiful collarbone...\n非常规极限视角 (Extreme Angles): POV, first-person view, looking down at the camera (俯视镜头), looking up (仰视), dutch angle (倾斜构图), close-up shot (特写), macro shot of collarbone (锁骨微距)...\n情绪化光影 (Emotional Light): golden hour, twilight, rim light (边缘光), backlighting (逆光), Tyndall effect (丁达尔效应), lens flare (镜头光晕), cinematic lighting, moody lighting, light and shadow play...\n微越界肢体 (Intimate Posture): leaning back (向后微仰), sideways posture (侧身), looking back over the shoulder (回眸), intimate eye contact (亲密对视), fatal attraction, reaching out hand (伸出手), slightly parted lips...\n工作流与输出规范\n根据用户的【主题】（如：图书馆、操场、雨天等）时，必须只输出一段英文正面提示词，严禁输出任何中文解释、负面提示词、标题或其他说明性文字。", "", "video", 24, 256, 126866066320324, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 31, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 32, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "link": 35, "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget":